<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <h1 style="color: #1a1a1a;">Check-in Reminder</h1>
  <p>Dear {{guestName}},</p>
  <p>This is a friendly reminder that your check-in at <strong>{{hotelName}}</strong> is tomorrow ({{checkIn}}).</p>
  <p>Your booking reference is <strong>{{bookingReference}}</strong>.</p>
  <p>Please present this reference at the front desk upon arrival.</p>
  <p>We look forward to welcoming you!</p>
  <p>Hotel OS Team</p>
</body>
</html>
